cff-version: 1.2.0
title: RingdateR Web
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the original RingdateR
  publication (Reynolds, Edge & Black, 2021) given under
  "preferred-citation".
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: David J.
    family-names: Reynolds
  - given-names: David C.
    family-names: Edge
  - given-names: Bryan A.
    family-names: Black
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free JavaScript / browser port of RingdateR, a tool for the
  statistical and visual crossdating of annually-resolved growth series
  (tree rings and mollusc, fish and coral increments).
repository-code: 'https://github.com/DaveEdge1/ringdater-web'
